# Redaction patterns for `lore fold` (#425). One POSIX ERE per line; blank lines
# and lines starting with "#" are ignored. A match is replaced by [REDACTED]
# before an event reaches the vault; the event is still committed. The fold
# uses a control-character sed delimiter, so any ERE is safe. Owner of this
# list: this file.
# GitHub tokens (classic prefixes and fine-grained)
gh[pousr]_[A-Za-z0-9]{20,}
github_pat_[A-Za-z0-9_]{20,}
# Anthropic API keys
sk-ant-[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16,}
# AWS access key IDs
AKIA[0-9A-Z]{16}
# Bearer tokens
[Bb]earer[[:space:]]+[A-Za-z0-9._~+/=-]{8,}
# password= / token= style assignments (the whole assignment is masked)
([Pp]ass(word|wd)|[Tt]oken|[Ss]ecret|[Aa]pi[_-]?[Kk]ey)[[:space:]]*=[[:space:]]*[^[:space:]]+
# PEM private-key headers
-----BEGIN ([A-Z]+ )*PRIVATE KEY-----
